===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who [[admire]]s another romantically but purposely remains [[anonymous]] to the extent that the subject of the admiration is unaware of the admirer's identity.
#: {{uxi|en|I received a Valentine's card from my '''secret admirer'''.}}

